How're you?

261
00:25:49.750 --> 00:25:55.333
Hey honey! Come here you..

262
00:25:55.833 --> 00:25:58.083
If something happened to you, I'd have killed you.

263
00:25:58.583 --> 00:26:03.166
Is this any way to greet your boyfriend?

264
00:26:03.666 --> 00:26:04.375
How're you?

265
00:26:04.875 --> 00:26:07.333
Hey, how are you? - I am fine, how are you?

266
00:26:07.833 --> 00:26:10.041
Mr. Rathod.. - Aslam, you keep growing tall.

267
00:26:10.541 --> 00:26:14.166
Stop acting..

268
00:26:14.666 --> 00:26:16.500
Sexy jacket, bro. - It is.

269
00:26:17.000 --> 00:26:17.791
Hi, Ajay.. - Hi.

270
00:26:18.291 --> 00:26:20.000
Flight lieutenant Ajay Rathod. - She's right.

271
00:26:20.500 --> 00:26:21.291
Hurry guys, I'm famished.

272
00:26:21.791 --> 00:26:22.791
You won't get any food here.

273
00:26:23.291 --> 00:26:26.208
Hey Mitro, my mother, how are you? - Your Mitro is dead.

274
00:26:26.708 --> 00:26:29.500
Stay away! You remembered your mother after two months..

275
00:26:30.000 --> 00:26:30.833
..I carried you in my stomach for nine months..

276
00:26:31.333 --> 00:26:32.291
..and washed your bum for years..

277
00:26:32.791 --> 00:26:35.708
..and you come here as being a gentleman.

278
00:26:36.208 --> 00:26:36.916
Get lost!

279
00:26:37.416 --> 00:26:40.458
Does anyone bother to check if Mitro is alive or dead?

280
00:26:40.958 --> 00:26:42.000
What's up?

281
00:26:42.500 --> 00:26:43.458
You're drunk again.

282
00:26:43.958 --> 00:26:46.416
No. No. No. - One is in military and other keeps enjoying.

283
00:26:46.916 --> 00:26:50.291
First give us food ma, and then yell at us all night.

284
00:26:50.791 --> 00:26:52.791
None of you have eaten? What will happen to this generation?

285
00:26:53.291 --> 00:26:57.458
Sonia you've lost even more weight. - Really.. Mitro

286
00:26:57.958 --> 00:27:01.541
The girls of today have more bones and less flesh..

287
00:27:02.041 --> 00:27:03.333
How will you bear children?

288
00:27:03.833 --> 00:27:06.250
How will you bear children?

289
00:27:06.750 --> 00:27:10.916
Aslam, how are you my son? I didn't notice you.

290
00:27:11.416 --> 00:27:13.708
He is my true son who bothers to check on me.

291
00:27:14.208 --> 00:27:19.083
And he is one.. I committed a mistake by sending you to city.

292
00:27:19.583 --> 00:27:22.458
Look ma, what I brought for you.

293
00:27:22.958 --> 00:27:27.291
Your daughter-in-law. Her name is Sue.

294
00:27:27.791 --> 00:27:29.250
What? A foreigner?

295
00:27:29.750 --> 00:27:31.458
Brought her especially from London.

296
00:27:31.958 --> 00:27:33.750
That's why I was away for so long.

297
00:27:34.250 --> 00:27:36.875
I told her that's it's your first trip to India.

298
00:27:37.375 --> 00:27:39.750
Give me your blessings Ma.

299
00:27:40.250 --> 00:27:42.541
Your son's such a brat.

300
00:27:43.041 --> 00:27:50.041
God! She understands Hindi!

301
00:27:50.541 --> 00:27:54.541
She understands everything.

302
00:27:55.041 --> 00:27:57.541
You really understand everything? - Yes.

303
00:27:58.041 --> 00:27:58.833
What a problem!

304
00:27:59.333 --> 00:28:03.250
I'm going off to sleep. Your beds are all ready.

305
00:28:03.750 --> 00:28:07.291
No need to drive so late at night.

306
00:28:07.791 --> 00:28:09.875
I saw them then..

307
00:28:10.375 --> 00:28:13.875
..like they leapt out of the pages of grandpa's dairy.

308
00:28:34.375 --> 00:28:37.291
Bhagat Singh, Chandrashekhar Azad, Rajguru ..

309
00:28:37.791 --> 00:28:40.791
..and Durga Bhabhi, Asfaqulla Khan

310
00:28:41.291 --> 00:28:44.916
And they were sitting right in front of me.

311
00:28:45.416 --> 00:28:48.083
Sue, where are you?

312
00:28:48.583 --> 00:28:50.291
Will you guys act in my film?

313
00:28:50.791 --> 00:28:51.541
What?

314
00:28:52.041 --> 00:28:55.541
Will you guys act in my film? You all are perfect.

315
00:28:56.041 --> 00:29:00.416
Hey, why are you guys laughing? I'm the hero of her film.

316
00:29:00.916 --> 00:29:03.458
Yeah we guys are champions when it comes to acting..

317
00:29:03.958 --> 00:29:05.666
..clowning around is all they do.

318
00:29:06.166 --> 00:29:07.250
I am serious okay.

319
00:29:07.750 --> 00:29:10.583
The four of you will be perfect for the roles of Bhagat Singh..

320
00:29:11.083 --> 00:29:13.458
..Chandrashekar Azad, Ashfaqulla Khan, Rajguru.

321
00:29:13.958 --> 00:29:15.500
And Sonia will be my Durga Bhabhi.

322
00:29:16.000 --> 00:29:18.000
She really knows Hindi!

323
00:29:18.500 --> 00:29:21.291
All this talk of patriotism is boring.

324
00:29:21.791 --> 00:29:25.791
Boring? These guys gave their lives for the freedom of your country.

325
00:29:26.291 --> 00:29:28.500
What freedom? Have you seen the state of this country?

326
00:29:29.000 --> 00:29:29.833
No one believes this rubbish thing.

327
00:29:30.333 --> 00:29:34.416
Excuse me! I believe in this country, Karan.

328
00:29:34.916 --> 00:29:36.833
Otherwise, why would I be fighting for it? - I don't know.

329
00:29:37.333 --> 00:29:41.083
Maybe because it's cool! Being a pilot.. flying an expensive plane.

330
00:29:41.583 --> 00:29:42.416
You get to wear fancy jackets..

331
00:29:42.916 --> 00:29:46.625
And the women.. women love men in uniforms.

332
00:29:47.125 --> 00:29:49.416
Sure I love being a pilot. Sure it's cool.

333
00:29:49.916 --> 00:29:53.750
But I also feel proud of my country, and I can give my life for it.

334
00:29:54.250 --> 00:29:56.958
Proud of what?

335
00:29:57.458 --> 00:29:58.166
..this country's exploding population?

336
00:29:58.666 --> 00:30:00.791
..or unemployment.. - or corruption?

337
00:30:01.291 --> 00:30:02.500
Which of these are you really proud of?

338
00:30:03.000 --> 00:30:03.791
Come on guys..

339
00:30:04.291 --> 00:30:07.041
..no country's perfect Karan. We've got to make it better.

340
00:30:07.541 --> 00:30:08.458
Right.

341
00:30:08.958 --> 00:30:11.750
Ok, Ajay you make this country perfect.

342
00:30:12.250 --> 00:30:16.041
The minute I get my degree I'm out of this dump..

343
00:30:16.541 --> 00:30:19.250
You won't be able to leave us and go. - Wait and see.

344
00:30:19.750 --> 00:30:23.916
She speaks Hindi so well!

345
00:30:24.416 --> 00:30:27.125
Why didn't you tell me you son of a bitch..

346
00:30:27.625 --> 00:30:31.125
..I was making a fool of myself.

347
00:30:35.916 --> 00:30:38.791
At least ask them once, please.

348
00:30:39.291 --> 00:30:41.583
So you won't give up.

349
00:30:42.083 --> 00:30:45.791
Ok. But nobody will turn up.

350
00:30:46.291 --> 00:30:49.791
They will come. I'll get them. That's a promise.

351
00:30:57.125 --> 00:31:01.666
Karan put your cigarette out.

352
00:31:02.166 --> 00:31:03.458
Greetings grandpa!

353
00:31:03.958 --> 00:31:06.791
God bless you. When did you come?

354
00:31:07.291 --> 00:31:14.041
Just last night. Some friends.

355
00:31:14.541 --> 00:31:18.041
Who is he? - DJ's grandfather.

356
00:31:23.416 --> 00:31:29.625
Bye. - Bye Mitro.

357
00:31:30.125 --> 00:31:33.625
You...

358
00:31:54.500 --> 00:31:59.833
Good morning Karan. Back so early?

359
00:32:00.333 --> 00:32:03.125
I didn't know you were in town.

360
00:32:03.625 --> 00:32:05.416
Just arrived an hour ago.

361
00:32:05.916 --> 00:32:08.375
It was a long flight.

362
00:32:08.875 --> 00:32:11.666
Everything Ok at college? - Everything's fine Dad.

363
00:32:12.166 --> 00:32:13.583
Have you decided which American university..

364
00:32:14.083 --> 00:32:16.666
..you want to go to next year?

365
00:32:17.166 --> 00:32:20.041
Michigan university, it's a famous university.. then there's..

366
00:32:20.541 --> 00:32:22.250
Carnegie Mellon, Wharton..

367
00:32:22.750 --> 00:32:26.250
I know the list.

368
00:32:28.708 --> 00:32:32.041
Hello.. Karan wait!

369
00:32:32.541 --> 00:32:38.333
I can't hear you clearly call me later. I told you to call later.

370
00:32:38.833 --> 00:32:42.250
I know that you know about the lists.

371
00:32:42.750 --> 00:32:45.041
But life doesn't just happen to you.

372
00:32:45.541 --> 00:32:47.666
You've got to plan it..

373
00:32:48.166 --> 00:32:52.791
Every second someone is born in this country's drainage.

374
00:32:53.291 --> 00:32:56.250
Nobody cares about them. Neither the government nor God.

375
00:32:56.750 --> 00:32:58.916
I don't want.

376
00:32:59.416 --> 00:33:02.166
Do something. Or else you will be one of them.

377
00:33:02.666 --> 00:33:05.250
Please, don't start with your lectures.

378
00:33:05.750 --> 00:33:09.458
SMS generation. Any conversation that goes beyond..

379
00:33:09.958 --> 00:33:12.500
..four lines becomes a lecture.

380
00:33:13.000 --> 00:33:14.500
Hello..

381
00:33:15.000 --> 00:33:20.958
Signal's weak here give me a second. I will just go out and talk.

382
00:33:21.458 --> 00:33:26.791
Yes, tell me. The deal is off then, we are not interested..

383
00:33:27.291 --> 00:33:28.958
You are wasting my time.

384
00:33:29.458 --> 00:33:31.375
You know Russian quality is doubtful..

385
00:33:31.875 --> 00:33:32.833
..they can't afford to be arrogant.

386
00:33:33.333 --> 00:33:35.000
It is a profitable deal.

387
00:33:35.500 --> 00:33:39.458
Anyway in the open market they'd not get half of it.

388
00:33:39.958 --> 00:33:45.083
And you know how many fathers there..

389
00:33:45.583 --> 00:33:51.458
..are to every deal in India.

390
00:33:51.958 --> 00:33:53.291
Nothing.

391
00:33:53.791 --> 00:33:57.291
Tell them we won't bargain, they should wire the money to us.

392
00:34:20.291 --> 00:34:23.000
I did try to warn you.. they won't turn up.

393
00:34:23.500 --> 00:34:24.708
DJ promised me.

394
00:34:25.208 --> 00:34:26.750
Oh! DJ promised you!

395
00:34:27.250 --> 00:34:28.500
So you really are a filmmaker?

396
00:34:29.000 --> 00:34:33.208
Karan.. Why are you so late?

397
00:34:33.708 --> 00:34:37.375
And where are the others?

398
00:34:37.875 --> 00:34:44.500
The Young Guns Of India. Very dramatic.

399
00:34:45.000 --> 00:34:47.458
Where are you going?

400
00:34:47.958 --> 00:34:50.500
Well that's one part cast.

401
00:34:51.000 --> 00:34:54.500
I am sure Karan can tell us where his friends are.

402
00:35:02.750 --> 00:35:08.916
How are you? I am fine. I am preparing omelets.

403
00:35:09.416 --> 00:35:11.666
She's an eight. Yeah! Wow! Nine.

404
00:35:12.166 --> 00:35:15.333
What a girl! Oye Chotu get me a cup of tea..

405
00:35:15.833 --> 00:35:20.541
Two, tell her to go..

406
00:35:21.041 --> 00:35:21.916
Six..

407
00:35:22.416 --> 00:35:27.500
Ten! What? - Ten from far and enough from close,

408
00:35:28.000 --> 00:35:32.000
Dude.. looks at those legs!

409
00:35:32.500 --> 00:35:35.333
Shake it baby, shake it..

410
00:35:35.833 --> 00:35:36.750
Oh shit!

411
00:35:37.250 --> 00:35:38.416
Don't be silly, that's at least an eight.

412
00:35:38.916 --> 00:35:41.625
Thought I'd find you stuffing your faces.

413
00:35:42.125 --> 00:35:44.458
You lazy good for nothings.

414
00:35:44.958 --> 00:35:46.833
We were about to come.. but..

415
00:35:47.333 --> 00:35:48.833
..we are waiting for Karan actually.

416
00:35:49.333 --> 00:35:51.000
Oh! So you were waiting for Karan. - Yes.

417
00:35:51.500 --> 00:35:54.375
Karan was there on time. ..Yeah!

418
00:35:54.875 --> 00:35:57.458
We are waiting for him here and he was waiting for us there.

419
00:35:57.958 --> 00:36:01.958
We were supposed to meet here. - What confusion..

420
00:36:02.458 --> 00:36:04.250
You're Ashfaqulla Khan.

421
00:36:04.750 --> 00:36:06.541
You're Rajguru. - The hero right!

422
00:36:07.041 --> 00:36:08.250
And you know who you are?

423
00:36:08.750 --> 00:36:10.958
The Master of Disguise and Deception.

424
00:36:11.458 --> 00:36:13.291
Chandrashekhar Azad.

425
00:36:13.791 --> 00:36:15.083
I will die on you.

426
00:36:15.583 --> 00:36:18.291
Learn the lines properly, we meet tomorrow.

427
00:36:18.791 --> 00:36:21.125
The practice will be tomorrow at 8 a.m. sharp!

428
00:36:21.625 --> 00:36:23.666
Nine. - Sharp at eight.

429
00:36:24.166 --> 00:36:27.666
That's fine. - We've already wasted a day..

430
00:36:32.708 --> 00:36:35.666
Aslam, your sister-in-law looks even better when she's angry.

431
00:36:36.166 --> 00:36:46.791
I have fallen in love.

432
00:36:46.291 --> 00:36:48.791
What are you doing Laxman?

433
00:36:53.166 --> 00:36:56.000
Party High Command is really happy with your work.

434
00:36:56.500 --> 00:37:00.708
These demonstrations that you have started against Western culture..

435
00:37:01.208 --> 00:37:05.666
..they've helped us overshadow other parties.

436
00:37:06.166 --> 00:37:08.666
Come. Come.

437
00:37:09.166 --> 00:37:14.625
Give me. - Take this.

438
00:37:15.125 --> 00:37:18.083
This is for you. And this is for your boys.

439
00:37:18.583 --> 00:37:20.333
It's not necessary, Mishraji.

440
00:37:20.833 --> 00:37:22.750
I'm not doing this for money.

441
00:37:23.250 --> 00:37:26.291
I really believe in the principles of my party.

442
00:37:26.791 --> 00:37:28.333
That's fine Laxman..

443
00:37:28.833 --> 00:37:35.166
..but every movement needs fuel.. Keep it.

444
00:37:35.666 --> 00:37:41.333
Come, how is your work going on?

445
00:37:41.833 --> 00:37:45.000
March the 14th we started our rehearsals.

446
00:37:45.500 --> 00:37:49.000
To say I was nervous, would be an understatement.

447
00:37:57.000 --> 00:38:01.333
"There is nothing you can do to break me."

448
00:38:01.833 --> 00:38:04.541
"Because I have made pain my friend."

449
00:38:05.041 --> 00:38:08.541
"..As I hold Death's fingers."

450
00:38:21.166 --> 00:38:23.875
DJ idiot, don't spoil my concentration.

451
00:38:24.375 --> 00:38:27.958
Please guys, be serious. - Okay, sorry..

452
00:38:28.458 --> 00:38:33.125
Look, Death's finger.

453
00:38:33.625 --> 00:38:36.041
"I've committed my life to the freedom of this country.

454
00:38:36.541 --> 00:38:38.125
..I know you want me to get married..

455
00:38:38.625 --> 00:38:40.125
..but I have made freedom my bride.."

456
00:38:40.625 --> 00:38:44.250
"Your son, Bhagat Singh."

457
00:38:44.750 --> 00:38:47.083
Who talks like this for God's sake? - Your son.

458
00:38:47.583 --> 00:38:49.166
My bride is freedom.. what's his problem?

459
00:38:49.666 --> 00:38:51.625
I think it's a good line for Sukhi..

460
00:38:52.125 --> 00:38:53.166
Since no girl is ever going to marry him..

461
00:38:53.666 --> 00:38:56.291
Let freedom be his bride.

462
00:38:56.791 --> 00:38:58.416
Laugh bastards, laugh. I won't invite you in my marriage.

463
00:38:58.916 --> 00:39:02.416
You were happy just now and now you turned sad.

464
00:39:08.166 --> 00:39:13.958
"What sign did you make by touching my heart?"

465
00:39:14.458 --> 00:39:20.041
"The climate has changed and I have started liking the environment.."

466
00:39:20.541 --> 00:39:22.791
Wow! Great!

467
00:39:23.291 --> 00:39:26.208
This is the sari round of the Miss Freedom contest.

468
00:39:26.708 --> 00:39:29.125
Just thought it would help me get into the character.

469
00:39:29.625 --> 00:39:31.666
Wow! - Idiots.

470
00:39:32.166 --> 00:39:34.625
Hey, Miss Universe .. ..ity.

471
00:39:35.125 --> 00:39:37.458
Look guys this isn't going to work.

472
00:39:37.958 --> 00:39:42.208
You have to work hard to bring out the characters. And be serious.

473
00:39:42.708 --> 00:39:46.250
Unless you emote from within..

474
00:39:46.750 --> 00:39:49.375
..you won't understand these characters.

475
00:39:49.875 --> 00:39:54.541
Try.. it will come from within you.

476
00:39:55.041 --> 00:39:57.833
See, he's got a hold of his character already.

477
00:39:58.333 --> 00:40:01.041
You understood the character pretty fast.

478
00:40:01.541 --> 00:40:03.333
Please stop it. Just shut up or get out.

479
00:40:03.833 --> 00:40:06.625
See! Now you look like a revolutionary!

480
00:40:07.125 --> 00:40:10.500
Whatever you say Gulabo, you need me to create the mood.

481
00:40:11.000 --> 00:40:12.666
DJ watch it.

482
00:40:13.166 --> 00:40:17.125
Now she's upset! She's is upset..

483
00:40:17.625 --> 00:40:21.583
She is smiling, she will be allured if she smiles.

484
00:40:22.083 --> 00:40:25.666
Those are the words of a 23 year old.

485
00:40:26.166 --> 00:40:29.416
That's how old Bhagat Singh was when he died: 23.

486
00:40:29.916 --> 00:40:31.583
Those were different times Sue.

487
00:40:32.083 --> 00:40:33.333
Today, if you tell people that you ..

488
00:40:33.833 --> 00:40:35.333
..want to give your life for your country..

489
00:40:35.833 --> 00:40:39.500
..they'll call you mad.

490
00:40:40.000 --> 00:40:41.750
Exactly.

491
00:40:42.250 --> 00:40:46.958
I can't relate to this..

492
00:40:47.458 --> 00:40:48.833
That's it. Don't think.

493
00:40:49.333 --> 00:40:54.958
Feel. Just read the words, and you'll get what he was feeling.

494
00:40:55.458 --> 00:40:57.083
Why don't we try again?

495
00:40:57.583 --> 00:41:00.833
Let's try again..

496
00:41:01.333 --> 00:41:07.125
I've committed my life to the freedom of this country. - Good.

497
00:41:07.625 --> 00:41:13.250
..a job.. a well settled life.. these things don't matter anymore.

498
00:41:13.750 --> 00:41:20.750
..I know you want me to get married..

499
00:41:21.250 --> 00:41:24.750
..but I have made freedom my bride..

500
00:41:34.750 --> 00:41:38.250
I the son Mother India.. swear on this..

501
00:41:45.041 --> 00:41:53.625
I the son Mother India.. swear on this pious fire..

502
00:41:53.125 --> 00:41:56.500
This Aslam is a real stud..

503
00:41:57.000 --> 00:42:03.500
Take a look at the packaging. Poetry, good looks, reading hands!

504
00:42:04.000 --> 00:42:09.708
DJ, I'm scared at times that I'll remain a bachelor all my life.

505
00:42:10.208 --> 00:42:14.041
Trust me I won't let you die a bachelor.

506
00:42:14.541 --> 00:42:18.291
Promise.. - It's DJ's promise.

507
00:42:18.791 --> 00:42:20.125
Oh no.

508
00:42:20.625 --> 00:42:23.458
"You'll be writing people's destinies..

509
00:42:23.958 --> 00:42:26.000
.." "You'll be bringing them on right path.."

510
00:42:26.500 --> 00:42:29.500
Papu, change the channel. - "You know the art of changing destiny.."

511
00:42:30.000 --> 00:42:33.500
"You have to go far beyond the lines.." - I like that.

512
00:42:38.208 --> 00:42:40.500
Your love line is very strong..

513
00:42:41.000 --> 00:42:44.166
The man of your dreams will come along in a black T-shirt and say:.

514
00:42:44.666 --> 00:42:49.583
"What sign did you make by touching my heart.."

515
00:42:50.083 --> 00:42:53.125
