"Don't hesitate, my friend. Paint your patriotism over everything.."

767
01:01:39.458 --> 01:01:44.041
"Watch as it brings out the colour of patriotism, my friend.."

768
01:01:44.541 --> 01:01:48.583
"Take some soil of my land.."

769
01:01:49.083 --> 01:01:57.958
"Take some soil of my land, the scent of this air.."

770
01:01:58.458 --> 01:02:02.500
"Add the breath of my being, the throbbing of my heart.."

771
01:02:03.000 --> 01:02:08.541
"And the zeal, that races through my blood.."

772
01:02:09.041 --> 01:02:13.250
"Take all these and stir it. Then watch as it brings out the colour"

773
01:02:13.750 --> 01:02:20.041
"Watch as it brings out the colour of patriotism, my friend."

774
01:02:20.541 --> 01:02:22.416
"Watch as it brings out the colour."

775
01:02:22.916 --> 01:02:24.666
"Watch as it brings out the colour of.."

776
01:02:25.166 --> 01:02:26.541
"Watch as it brings out the colour of.."

777
01:02:27.041 --> 01:02:31.125
"Watch as it brings out the colour of.."

778
01:02:31.625 --> 01:02:37.875
"Watch as it brings out the colour of.."

779
01:02:38.375 --> 01:02:42.583
"Watch as it brings out the colour of.."

780
01:02:43.083 --> 01:02:46.583
"Watch as it brings out the colour of.."

781
01:02:52.958 --> 01:02:56.666
"Watch as it brings out the colour of.."

782
01:02:57.166 --> 01:03:01.583
"Watch as it brings out the colour of.."

783
01:03:02.083 --> 01:03:06.916
"Watch as it brings out the colour of.."

784
01:03:07.416 --> 01:03:18.416
"Watch as it brings out the colour of patriotism, my friend."

785
01:03:18.916 --> 01:03:27.541
The Kakori robbery on August 9th 1925 that's where it all started.

786
01:03:28.041 --> 01:03:31.541
Nothing would ever be the same after that.

787
01:03:48.000 --> 01:03:49.958
British Officers.. around 20 to 25 of them.

788
01:03:50.458 --> 01:03:51.958
We have to call it off! We've nearly reached Kakori.

789
01:03:52.458 --> 01:03:55.958
Stop Ashfaq, quick.

790
01:04:02.708 --> 01:04:05.166
Ashfaq, stop!

791
01:04:05.666 --> 01:04:09.166
It's too late to back out now.. Come on.. Move!

792
01:04:25.708 --> 01:04:29.208
Get inside!

793
01:04:41.208 --> 01:04:42.625
Keep the windows shut..

794
01:04:43.125 --> 01:04:44.833
..no Indian will be hurt..

795
01:04:45.333 --> 01:04:46.750
Come on!

796
01:04:47.250 --> 01:04:49.458
The keys! - You won't get away with this.

797
01:04:49.958 --> 01:04:52.541
Give me the keys! - I don't have it. I don't have it.

798
01:04:53.041 --> 01:04:56.541
Banwari get the sledge-hammer.

799
01:04:58.791 --> 01:05:02.291
I'll handle them. You go get the money..

800
01:05:16.583 --> 01:05:20.541
Kakori had sent shock waves throughout the establishment.

801
01:05:21.041 --> 01:05:23.708
But we had none to blame but ourselves.

802
01:05:24.208 --> 01:05:27.708
What we were hearing were the echoes of our own guns.

803
01:05:38.291 --> 01:05:42.750
Fire..

804
01:05:43.250 --> 01:05:45.958
Load.

805
01:05:46.458 --> 01:05:49.958
Fire..

806
01:05:54.958 --> 01:05:58.458
Load

807
01:06:00.666 --> 01:06:04.166
Fire..

808
01:07:08.000 --> 01:07:11.250
Jallianwala Baug meeting essentially nonviolent people..

809
01:07:11.750 --> 01:07:13.125
..considered taking up arms.

810
01:07:13.625 --> 01:07:16.750
This was when Bhagat Singh stepped out of the shadows..

811
01:07:17.250 --> 01:07:19.125
..to claim his destiny.

812
01:07:19.625 --> 01:07:23.250
I've committed my life to the freedom of this country.

813
01:07:23.750 --> 01:07:28.833
Comfort and other worldly desires do not attract me.

814
01:07:29.333 --> 01:07:33.125
I know you want me to get married and settle down..

815
01:07:33.625 --> 01:07:35.583
..like all parents do.

816
01:07:36.083 --> 01:07:39.500
But freedom is my bride.

817
01:07:40.000 --> 01:07:44.208
I hope you'll forgive me. Your most obedient son..

818
01:07:44.708 --> 01:07:47.958
Bhagat Singh.

819
01:07:48.458 --> 01:07:49.750
Cut.

820
01:07:50.250 --> 01:07:53.750
Let's take a break.

821
01:07:57.250 --> 01:08:00.750
Breakfast? No..

822
01:08:20.916 --> 01:08:21.541
Put it there.

823
01:08:22.041 --> 01:08:29.500
General Dyer? How can one even think of doing something like this?

824
01:08:30.000 --> 01:08:32.000
I can't believe that he actually killed more..

825
01:08:32.500 --> 01:08:34.083
.. than 400 people at Jallianwala Baugh.

826
01:08:34.583 --> 01:08:37.250
379.. that was the official figure.

827
01:08:37.750 --> 01:08:40.000
Actually nearly 1000 people were butchered..

828
01:08:40.500 --> 01:08:44.000
Here.

829
01:08:47.666 --> 01:08:53.208
Last year at the tomb of Peer Sai, I prayed for Daljeet's well being.

830
01:08:53.708 --> 01:08:54.833
Who's Daljeet?

831
01:08:55.333 --> 01:08:58.208
We were the epitome of tolerance.

832
01:08:58.708 --> 01:09:01.250
Even an ant reacts. But we are conditioned ..

833
01:09:01.750 --> 01:09:03.666
..to take everything lying down.

834
01:09:04.166 --> 01:09:05.375
Rubbish! It's today's generation

835
01:09:05.875 --> 01:09:06.833
.. which lacks the will to do anything

836
01:09:07.333 --> 01:09:08.708
Have you ever heard of Shaheed Uddham Singh?

837
01:09:09.208 --> 01:09:13.083
He went all the way to London and killed that Dyer.

838
01:09:13.583 --> 01:09:16.375
..because he was also a part of the Jallianwala Baugh massacre.

839
01:09:16.875 --> 01:09:20.458
Eat it Sonia. The butter will strengthen your bones.

840
01:09:20.958 --> 01:09:24.666
In Punjab every mother sends at least one son to the army.

841
01:09:25.166 --> 01:09:28.000
Why should we retreat? Sacrifice runs in our blood.

842
01:09:28.500 --> 01:09:30.583
Only idiots like DJ retreat.

843
01:09:31.083 --> 01:09:32.625
Why does it always come back to me?

844
01:09:33.125 --> 01:09:35.750
Shut up and eat your paratha. Gollu, bring the lassi.

845
01:09:36.250 --> 01:09:38.791
We are taught from our childhood to adjust our self.

846
01:09:39.291 --> 01:09:40.958
Six people sitting on a seat for four..

847
01:09:41.458 --> 01:09:47.125
..someone will squeeze in and say Please adjust!

848
01:09:47.625 --> 01:09:51.875
Hey! Why are you adjusting? Come sit, sit.

849
01:09:52.375 --> 01:09:58.208
Hey, brother, hey, brother.

850
01:09:58.708 --> 01:10:01.416
Strange. Isn't it?

851
01:10:01.916 --> 01:10:09.750
We are being hunted like animals in our own country..

852
01:10:10.250 --> 01:10:13.625
Ashfaq you should cross the border and get to Afghanistan..

853
01:10:14.125 --> 01:10:15.625
We have many Muslim friends there.

854
01:10:16.125 --> 01:10:17.625
You will be safe with them.

855
01:10:18.125 --> 01:10:19.916
After all you're one of their own.

856
01:10:20.416 --> 01:10:22.125
One of their own? - Hmm..

857
01:10:22.625 --> 01:10:26.125
Why am I not one of your own?

858
01:10:28.000 --> 01:10:30.916
Ashfaq.. I never meant..

859
01:10:31.416 --> 01:10:34.875
Ashfaq..

860
01:10:35.375 --> 01:10:38.541
I didn't mean to hurt you.

861
01:10:39.041 --> 01:10:42.041
This is your country as much as it is mine.

862
01:10:42.541 --> 01:10:48.666
You have a right to fight and die for it too..

863
01:10:49.166 --> 01:10:51.708
Forgive me. - Ram, let us not talk of dying..

864
01:10:52.208 --> 01:10:55.708
I pray that we all live to see our children live in a free country.

865
01:11:01.750 --> 01:11:05.250
Ram run!

866
01:12:02.291 --> 01:12:05.791
Run.. Run..

867
01:12:18.166 --> 01:12:20.625
Where are your other friends?

868
01:12:21.125 --> 01:12:24.625
Where's Azad?

869
01:12:27.208 --> 01:12:31.583
Azad was not a man to be found easily.

870
01:12:32.083 --> 01:12:37.250
A master of disguises appeared and vanished at will.

871
01:12:37.750 --> 01:12:39.500
After months of frustration a break through ..

872
01:12:40.000 --> 01:12:42.291
.. came for the British Government.

873
01:12:42.791 --> 01:12:47.333
Banwari Lal, weakest of the revolutionaries in captivity.

874
01:12:47.833 --> 01:12:50.958
The man who had given us the whereabouts of..

875
01:12:51.458 --> 01:12:54.958
..Bismil and Ashfaqulla agreed to be the bait to trap Azad.

876
01:13:12.000 --> 01:13:15.500
Banwari!

877
01:14:20.791 --> 01:14:25.541
Okay! "Just make an eye to eye contact and learn.."

878
01:14:26.041 --> 01:14:27.500
I loved those songs and dances.

879
01:14:28.000 --> 01:14:29.791
That's the reason we make films in this country.. to dance.

880
01:14:30.291 --> 01:14:33.458
Hey, you Hollywood's relative.

881
01:14:33.958 --> 01:14:37.000
"Just make an eye contact.."

882
01:14:37.500 --> 01:14:39.541
So where are we going? - Yes, where are we going?

883
01:14:40.041 --> 01:14:42.250
Hello! Where?

884
01:14:42.750 --> 01:14:46.250
Special day, special place! - Special Day?

885
01:15:57.708 --> 01:16:00.791
It's amazing. - Isn't it?

886
01:16:01.291 --> 01:16:05.833
Ever since I was a kid I used to come here..

887
01:16:06.333 --> 01:16:09.041
..to watch planes take off.. and watch ..

888
01:16:09.541 --> 01:16:13.041
.. them till they don't disappear in the sky.

889
01:16:44.041 --> 01:16:45.958
These guys have gone crazy!

890
01:16:46.458 --> 01:16:48.375
Come on, face it, you'd love to do that really.

891
01:16:48.875 --> 01:16:50.791
What? Take my shirt off and howl at planes.

892
01:16:51.291 --> 01:16:53.541
I won't mind if you do.

893
01:16:54.041 --> 01:16:57.541
Dream on buddy..

894
01:17:02.791 --> 01:17:04.916
Hey, Wild people. - Boys and girls and ..

895
01:17:05.416 --> 01:17:06.791
.. Sukhi who is always after girls..

896
01:17:07.291 --> 01:17:08.083
Why me all the time?

897
01:17:08.583 --> 01:17:11.500
I want to make a special announcement..

898
01:17:12.000 --> 01:17:16.250
Ma'am, I was wondering if you'd like to ..

899
01:17:16.750 --> 01:17:20.250
.. spend the rest of your life with me..

900
01:17:24.791 --> 01:17:28.291
Will you please marry me?

901
01:17:31.208 --> 01:17:36.250
This is a real love.

902
01:17:36.750 --> 01:17:40.250
"Ajay has done it.." "Ajay has done it.."

903
01:18:16.958 --> 01:18:28.500
"Without saying a word, you steal my heart."

904
01:18:29.000 --> 01:18:36.541
"I'll find happiness by your..

905
01:18:37.041 --> 01:18:45.583
..side I can't stay apart."

906
01:18:46.083 --> 01:19:00.166
"My life tastes sweet now..

907
01:19:00.666 --> 01:19:07.583
..since you walked..

908
01:19:08.083 --> 01:19:16.625
.. through that door."

909
01:19:17.125 --> 01:19:24.500
"When your arms wrap around me..

910
01:19:25.000 --> 01:19:33.583
..I know I've found my shore."

911
01:19:34.083 --> 01:19:40.500
"Without saying a word..

912
01:19:41.000 --> 01:19:44.500
..you steal my heart."

913
01:20:17.708 --> 01:20:23.750
"Sweep through the streets of..

914
01:20:24.250 --> 01:20:33.250
..my mind Like a gentle spring."

915
01:20:33.750 --> 01:20:39.666
"Walk through the corridors of my heart..

916
01:20:40.166 --> 01:20:48.250
..fill the caravan of my dreams."

917
01:20:48.750 --> 01:20:55.583
"I sway to the song..

918
01:20:56.083 --> 01:21:05.375
..of your soul."

919
01:21:05.875 --> 01:21:12.125
"Without saying a word..

920
01:21:12.625 --> 01:21:20.291
..you steal my heart."

921
01:21:20.791 --> 01:21:28.041
"I'll find happiness by your side..

922
01:21:28.541 --> 01:21:32.041
..I can't stay apart."

923
01:21:48.208 --> 01:21:54.541
The first thing that hit me about this man was his voice.

924
01:21:55.041 --> 01:21:58.541
I knew then my job was not going to be easy.

925
01:21:59.041 --> 01:22:00.541
I'll come back later.

926
01:22:01.041 --> 01:22:07.833
My prayers won't stop till my country gets its freedom.

927
01:22:08.333 --> 01:22:11.791
I don't think you can wait till then.

928
01:22:12.291 --> 01:22:17.833
My name is James McKinley. I'm here to find out from you..

929
01:22:18.333 --> 01:22:21.666
..where Azad and the other terrorists are hiding.

930
01:22:22.166 --> 01:22:25.666
Not terrorists. Revolutionaries. Call them Revolutionaries.

931
01:22:40.750 --> 01:22:48.708
Breaking a man bit by bit, they said it would get easier by time.

932
01:22:49.208 --> 01:22:52.708
It never did.

933
01:23:25.791 --> 01:23:30.333
The torture went on for sometime but Bismil didn't break.

934
01:23:30.833 --> 01:23:34.333
Also Ashfaq.

935
01:23:36.166 --> 01:23:41.541
Both men had made pain their friend, they didn't break.

936
01:23:42.041 --> 01:23:44.583
Instead they did something that I had never ..

937
01:23:45.083 --> 01:23:48.583
.. seen any prisoner do before.

938
01:24:02.875 --> 01:24:07.000
Death cannot take you Ashfaq..

939
01:24:07.500 --> 01:24:13.250
.. live in people's hearts and minds.

940
01:24:13.750 --> 01:24:16.541
..as the torture tore their bodies apart.

941
01:24:17.041 --> 01:24:21.625
I think it was the poetry that held their souls together..

942
01:24:22.125 --> 01:24:26.083
The torture didn't work so we thought of other ways.

943
01:24:26.583 --> 01:24:30.375
This is the Holy Quran.

944
01:24:30.875 --> 01:24:35.250
Hindus like Bismil will create a country for themselves.

945
01:24:35.750 --> 01:24:38.750
They're just using you.

946
01:24:39.250 --> 01:24:40.625
He's not fighting for Hindu freedom, ..

947
01:24:41.125 --> 01:24:43.916
.. he's fighting for Hindustan's freedom.

948
01:24:44.416 --> 01:24:47.833
But you won't be able to understand this.

949
01:24:48.333 --> 01:24:51.833
You've been a slave so long you've begun to like it.

950
01:24:56.958 --> 01:25:02.041
Tell us where Azad and the other terrorists are..

951
01:25:02.541 --> 01:25:06.041
..You can still save yourself.

952
01:25:13.250 --> 01:25:14.583
19 December.

953
01:25:15.083 --> 01:25:17.958
It's not your fault, Mr. McKinley..

954
01:25:18.458 --> 01:25:20.916
..you're only doing your duty.

955
01:25:21.416 --> 01:25:25.541
How can I stay loyal?

956
01:25:26.041 --> 01:25:29.958
Tell me..

957
01:25:30.458 --> 01:25:34.583
Tell me.

958
01:25:35.083 --> 01:25:38.583
How can this be the will of God?

959
01:25:51.125 --> 01:25:54.625
Things have become harder for me.

960
01:25:57.333 --> 01:26:00.833
I have not been made to kill these people.

961
01:27:14.458 --> 01:27:17.958
Hey, hey guys what's up?

962
01:27:21.791 --> 01:27:24.708
What's wrong? Did someone die?

963
01:27:25.208 --> 01:27:29.541
Sue.. I haven't seen these guys so serious.

964
01:27:30.041 --> 01:27:32.041
What are you doing to my friends?

965
01:27:32.541 --> 01:27:37.833
It's not me.. it's them. They've really begun to get into this.

966
01:27:38.333 --> 01:27:40.541
Hey Laxman, aren't you coming along?

967
01:27:41.041 --> 01:27:42.166
No. Some other time.

968
01:27:42.666 --> 01:27:44.583
Come on. It's my last night in town.

969
01:27:45.083 --> 01:27:46.416
I'm not really hungry.

970
01:27:46.916 --> 01:27:51.500
Watch us eat then. Come on.

971
01:27:52.000 --> 01:27:55.500
Come on.

972
01:28:06.416 --> 01:28:09.875
To two lovebirds.. may they always be happy.

973
01:28:10.375 --> 01:28:16.791
May the insanity and romance never die. Cheers.

974
01:28:17.291 --> 01:28:21.250
I said cheers guys. - Cheers. Cheers.. Cheers..

975
01:28:21.750 --> 01:28:23.625
I'm insane only about two things in my life.

976
01:28:24.125 --> 01:28:27.041
Sonia and flying.

977
01:28:27.541 --> 01:28:34.791
"What is my heart, take also my life.."

978
01:28:35.291 --> 01:28:40.125
You're lucky to feel so passionately about something.

979
01:28:40.625 --> 01:28:42.625
You have your poetry Aslam.

980
01:28:43.125 --> 01:28:45.375
Just like DJ has his singing.

981
01:28:45.875 --> 01:28:46.541
Everyone has passion for something inside ..

982
01:28:47.041 --> 01:28:47.916
.. them, they just have to find this 'thing'.

983
01:28:48.416 --> 01:28:50.250
Just like our revolutionaries..

984
01:28:50.750 --> 01:28:51.958
..their passion for freedom was greater than ..

985
01:28:52.458 --> 01:28:53.833
.. their love for their own lives.

986
01:28:54.333 --> 01:28:59.083
There's nothing in this world worth giving your life for. Nothing!

987
01:28:59.583 --> 01:29:01.958
Correct, except Umrao Jaan.

988
01:29:02.458 --> 01:29:05.458
Just once.. - Repeat.

989
01:29:05.958 --> 01:29:06.916
Easy DJ..

990
01:29:07.416 --> 01:29:08.958
Yes mama.

991
01:29:09.458 --> 01:29:12.500
Come on Karan, there are things worth giving your life for Karan.

992
01:29:13.000 --> 01:29:14.125
Please.

993
01:29:14.625 --> 01:29:15.791
Like what? Look at Bhagat Singh and Azad ..

994
01:29:16.291 --> 01:29:17.333
.. and the rest of those guys.

995
01:29:17.833 --> 01:29:19.291
They gave their lives for this country.

996
01:29:19.791 --> 01:29:22.625
Look what happened. All for nothing.

997
01:29:23.125 --> 01:29:28.291
It's a shit-hole today. Does any one care about them?

998
01:29:28.791 --> 01:29:29.791
I give a shit.

999
01:29:30.291 --> 01:29:33.791
People like Ajay who fight for their country give a shit.

1000
01:29:34.291 --> 01:29:36.166
So that people like you can sleep peacefully.

1001
01:29:36.666 --> 01:29:40.666
Give life. - Sonia get real.

1002
01:29:41.166 --> 01:29:42.250
Sonia's right.

1003
01:29:42.750 --> 01:29:46.250
Sue, it's all-fine for a foreigner like you to say all this..

1004
01:29:46.750 --> 01:29:51.000
Out here we're fighting for basics..

1005
01:29:51.500 --> 01:29:52.875
..food, clothing and shelter.

1006
01:29:53.375 --> 01:29:57.083
Out here you try to change things you'll get even more screwed.

1007
01:29:57.583 --> 01:30:01.041
Corruption is in our DNA.

1008
01:30:01.541 --> 01:30:02.875
There is no future for this country.

1009
01:30:03.375 --> 01:30:07.500
She's talking about the past, you're thinking about the future..

1010
01:30:08.000 --> 01:30:10.083
One leg in the past and one leg in the future..

1011
01:30:10.583 --> 01:30:12.458
..that's why we're pissing on the present..

1012
01:30:12.958 --> 01:30:16.458
DJ just shut up. For once in life get serious.

1013
01:30:20.791 --> 01:30:26.375
Karan, it's easy to sit on the outside and be a critic..

1014
01:30:26.875 --> 01:30:30.250
..blaming others is even easier.

1015
01:30:30.750 --> 01:30:32.166
If you have so many problems then why ..

1016
01:30:32.666 --> 01:30:33.750
.. don't you go out there and change things?

1017
01:30:34.250 --> 01:30:35.875
This is your country too.

1018
01:30:36.375 --> 01:30:41.000
Join politics, the police force, government and clean it up.

1019
01:30:41.500 --> 01:30:44.791
But you won't! I'll tell you why..

1020
01:30:45.291 --> 01:30:51.500
Because that takes hard work. It's easier to crib.

1021
