"Yet, our blood was raging."

1290
01:57:10.375 --> 01:57:11.375
Someone get a doctor! Immediately!

1291
01:57:11.875 --> 01:57:12.791
Take her to emergency ward. - Yes doctor.

1292
01:57:13.291 --> 01:57:16.250
Fast.

1293
01:57:16.750 --> 01:57:20.250
Please stay here. I'll take care of patient. Please.

1294
01:57:26.708 --> 01:57:30.208
Greetings!

1295
01:57:40.583 --> 01:57:44.541
They were beating up innocent people..

1296
01:57:45.041 --> 01:57:47.166
Why didn't you stop them?

1297
01:57:47.666 --> 01:57:49.375
You protested against the government, our own party..

1298
01:57:49.875 --> 01:57:51.208
The protest was not against the party..

1299
01:57:51.708 --> 01:57:53.791
The protest was not against the party..

1300
01:57:54.291 --> 01:57:57.541
.. it was for the truth.

1301
01:57:58.041 --> 01:58:00.708
So many pilots have died..

1302
01:58:01.208 --> 01:58:02.791
.. young boys who were fighting for our country.. killed..

1303
01:58:03.291 --> 01:58:08.583
.. so that someone in the government could make money.

1304
01:58:09.083 --> 01:58:11.875
And our party office doesn't do a thing about it.

1305
01:58:12.375 --> 01:58:15.875
Come.. Sit down.

1306
01:58:18.625 --> 01:58:22.125
Have some tea.

1307
01:58:26.083 --> 01:58:29.291
Don't be so emotional.

1308
01:58:29.791 --> 01:58:33.083
In politics there's no place for emotions.

1309
01:58:33.583 --> 01:58:36.333
We have big plans for you.

1310
01:58:36.833 --> 01:58:38.750
You have to go further. - I don't want to go anywhere.

1311
01:58:39.250 --> 01:58:44.625
Only dogs salivate when you show them bone Mishraji.

1312
01:58:45.125 --> 01:58:50.958
Beat him.. Beat him..

1313
01:58:51.458 --> 01:58:54.958
Beat him.. Beat him..

1314
01:59:15.041 --> 01:59:16.333
How's Aunty?

1315
01:59:16.833 --> 01:59:20.333
They're doing an MRI. We are waiting.

1316
01:59:37.250 --> 01:59:39.541
I am sorry, she's slipped into a coma.

1317
01:59:40.041 --> 01:59:45.708
Severe skull damage, coupled with the shock of her son's death.

1318
01:59:46.208 --> 01:59:50.041
That's an ugly gash. You need attention.

1319
01:59:50.541 --> 01:59:51.333
Nothing will happen to mother.

1320
01:59:51.833 --> 01:59:54.458
If you need anything, I am there.

1321
01:59:54.958 --> 01:59:58.458
Aslam.. How's he?

1322
02:00:01.666 --> 02:00:05.166
What have you come for? Haven't you done enough damage?

1323
02:00:08.250 --> 02:00:11.000
Uncle, it isn't what you think.

1324
02:00:11.500 --> 02:00:17.500
I'm not interested in what you think and what you want to do..

1325
02:00:18.000 --> 02:00:19.875
I'm just going to say this once.

1326
02:00:20.375 --> 02:00:22.875
Aslam doesn't know what is good or bad for him.

1327
02:00:23.375 --> 02:00:24.083
He's an emotional boy, always has been.

1328
02:00:24.583 --> 02:00:27.458
He listens to his heart, not his head.

1329
02:00:27.958 --> 02:00:30.958
These are bad times, for people like us.

1330
02:00:31.458 --> 02:00:36.625
Don't take him down with you.

1331
02:00:37.125 --> 02:00:40.625
Go on.. He's inside.

1332
02:00:56.541 --> 02:00:58.875
Guddu, go out.

1333
02:00:59.375 --> 02:01:02.500
All parts working?

1334
02:01:03.000 --> 02:01:06.750
Don't make me laugh, idiot. It hurts

1335
02:01:07.250 --> 02:01:09.125
How's aunty?

1336
02:01:09.625 --> 02:01:13.833
She's in a coma. - Oh God!

1337
02:01:14.333 --> 02:01:17.833
How can this be happening to us?

1338
02:01:29.041 --> 02:01:30.208
Some dinner?

1339
02:01:30.708 --> 02:01:33.500
No, don't worry Aunty.

1340
02:01:34.000 --> 02:01:35.500
We just came to see Aslam.

1341
02:01:36.000 --> 02:01:37.666
We've got to get back to the hospital.

1342
02:01:38.166 --> 02:01:40.416
Take care.

1343
02:01:40.916 --> 02:01:43.916
See you. Take care.

1344
02:01:44.416 --> 02:01:47.916
Take care.

1345
02:02:03.750 --> 02:02:08.083
Listen.. I..

1346
02:02:08.583 --> 02:02:12.083
I always.. I'm sorry.

1347
02:03:15.958 --> 02:03:19.458
Please eat.

1348
02:03:40.041 --> 02:03:44.250
Everything's falling apart..

1349
02:03:44.750 --> 02:03:48.250
.. and all I can do is stand and watch.

1350
02:03:53.750 --> 02:03:57.250
People like us don't count out here.

1351
02:04:01.333 --> 02:04:07.791
A hundred more Ajay's can die and nothing will change.

1352
02:04:08.291 --> 02:04:11.791
..and nothing will change.

1353
02:04:39.791 --> 02:04:43.291
Ajay did everything right, all his life.. yet..

1354
02:04:47.500 --> 02:04:54.833
.. he was a good pilot, a good friend, a good son..

1355
02:04:55.333 --> 02:05:01.416
.. he never harmed a soul, he never did anything wrong.

1356
02:05:01.916 --> 02:05:06.875
.. he didn't deserve this.. Everything is over suddenly.

1357
02:05:07.375 --> 02:05:10.875
.. Sonia didn't deserve this..

1358
02:05:24.208 --> 02:05:29.333
As I watched DJ sleep that night a funny thought occurred to me..

1359
02:05:29.833 --> 02:05:32.125
.. may be DJ wasn't sleeping.

1360
02:05:32.625 --> 02:05:36.125
May be none of them were. May be they were all waking up.

1361
02:06:17.250 --> 02:06:21.541
Hey Karan.. they've spoilt your jacket.

1362
02:06:22.041 --> 02:06:25.541
Long live India!

1363
02:06:55.541 --> 02:06:58.625
The bastard got away with it again.

1364
02:06:59.125 --> 02:07:01.666
What can we do..

1365
02:07:02.166 --> 02:07:06.625
..when the law of the land protects people like the Defence Minister.

1366
02:07:07.125 --> 02:07:10.666
We have to take drastic measures.

1367
02:07:11.166 --> 02:07:13.000
What drastic measures?

1368
02:07:13.500 --> 02:07:17.958
What do you want to do?

1369
02:07:18.458 --> 02:07:21.541
Kill him.

1370
02:07:22.041 --> 02:07:23.375
What?

1371
02:07:23.875 --> 02:07:28.000
Kill the Defence Minister! Have you lost your mind?

1372
02:07:28.500 --> 02:07:29.833
We aren't killers Sonia.

1373
02:07:30.333 --> 02:07:31.541
But they are.

1374
02:07:32.041 --> 02:07:33.166
Have you lost it Karan!

1375
02:07:33.666 --> 02:07:36.125
It's not a blood lust..

1376
02:07:36.625 --> 02:07:37.541
.. it's a matter of justice.

1377
02:07:38.041 --> 02:07:39.208
I'll get the gun.

1378
02:07:39.708 --> 02:07:41.833
Don't instigate, Pandey. We can't start killing..

1379
02:07:42.333 --> 02:07:44.625
.. people for any small reason.

1380
02:07:45.125 --> 02:07:48.083
You think Ajay's death is a small reason? - Karan, Karan.

1381
02:07:48.583 --> 02:07:50.000
Ajay's mother is a small reason?

1382
02:07:50.500 --> 02:07:53.291
It is not the matter. Understand me.

1383
02:07:53.791 --> 02:07:55.791
Lala Lajpat Rai's death has to be avenged.

1384
02:07:56.291 --> 02:07:57.541
Scott has to be killed.

1385
02:07:58.041 --> 02:08:01.541
But..

1386
02:08:08.250 --> 02:08:13.541
I always thought we didn't believe in anything.

1387
02:08:14.041 --> 02:08:17.541
So did I. Until now.

1388
02:08:27.916 --> 02:08:29.083
You're insane.

1389
02:08:29.583 --> 02:08:33.083
We can get him in the morning while he jogs.

1390
02:08:36.458 --> 02:08:40.458
Who's we, huh? Who's going to pull the trigger?

1391
02:08:40.958 --> 02:08:44.625
I'll do it!

1392
02:08:45.125 --> 02:08:46.958
There's less security in the morning.

1393
02:08:47.458 --> 02:08:49.250
There's a chance of getting caught.

1394
02:08:49.750 --> 02:08:53.250
No matter what we'll have to take this chance.

1395
02:09:39.583 --> 02:09:41.208
The Defence Minister was on his morning walk..

1396
02:09:41.708 --> 02:09:43.583
.. at 07:58AM with two body guards..

1397
02:09:44.083 --> 02:09:45.541
..when two unidentified gunmen opened fire.

1398
02:09:46.041 --> 02:09:47.083
He was hit by 3 bullets in his chest, and..

1399
02:09:47.583 --> 02:09:51.083
.. was declared dead on reaching hospital.

1400
02:10:03.000 --> 02:10:04.500
Government spokesmen believe that this is..

1401
02:10:05.000 --> 02:10:09.166
.. an attempt to destablize the govt.

1402
02:10:09.666 --> 02:10:12.500
The country has lost a great leader because..

1403
02:10:13.000 --> 02:10:15.041
.. of the cowardly act of some terrorists.

1404
02:10:15.541 --> 02:10:17.541
He was a true soldier, a true patriot..

1405
02:10:18.041 --> 02:10:20.833
.. who sacrificed his life for the country.

1406
02:10:21.333 --> 02:10:26.541
His contribution to the country cannot be described in words.

1407
02:10:27.041 --> 02:10:29.541
Sukhi!

1408
02:10:30.041 --> 02:10:31.041
Meanwhile our sources have discovered..

1409
02:10:31.541 --> 02:10:33.083
.. a telephonic conversation..

1410
02:10:33.583 --> 02:10:34.708
.. between the Late Defence Minister Shastri..

1411
02:10:35.208 --> 02:10:37.208
.. This conversation took place just a few..

1412
02:10:37.708 --> 02:10:41.166
.. days before the Defence Minister's murder.

1413
02:10:41.666 --> 02:10:43.500
Sir, nothing to worry, the Russians want..

1414
02:10:44.000 --> 02:10:44.958
.. us to reduce our commission.

1415
02:10:45.458 --> 02:10:49.708
Didn't you tell them it's not a defence deal, first it is our deal.

1416
02:10:50.208 --> 02:10:53.375
That's why I was also adamant, this is the deal, if you want..

1417
02:10:53.875 --> 02:10:57.375
Let's go.

1418
02:11:02.375 --> 02:11:05.875
Come on.

1419
02:11:06.791 --> 02:11:13.500
V.K. Shastri was killed by two unidentified persons.

1420
02:11:14.000 --> 02:11:15.000
Paaji, where's DJ?

1421
02:11:15.500 --> 02:11:19.000
They were just here.

1422
02:11:22.833 --> 02:11:26.333
He hasn't come home all night.

1423
02:11:28.125 --> 02:11:31.291
Is everything alright? - Yes.

1424
02:11:31.791 --> 02:11:35.291
He said he'd be spending the night at DJ's. - Thank you.

1425
02:11:49.000 --> 02:11:53.250
Have you seen DJ?

1426
02:11:53.750 --> 02:11:55.625
Is everything alright?

1427
02:11:56.125 --> 02:12:02.375
I can't find them or Sonia.. I don't know where they are.

1428
02:12:02.875 --> 02:12:09.333
Come with me.. Sit, sit.

1429
02:12:09.833 --> 02:12:13.958
Don't worry.. nothing will happen to these boys.. - But DJ..

1430
02:12:14.458 --> 02:12:16.541
Daljeet has always been a brat..

1431
02:12:17.041 --> 02:12:19.916
.. he used to disappear on his bike for days..

1432
02:12:20.416 --> 02:12:22.541
He used disappear for the whole night.

1433
02:12:23.041 --> 02:12:25.208
He is my only son, if it had been two to four..

1434
02:12:25.708 --> 02:12:28.208
.. I would have slept easily.

1435
02:12:28.708 --> 02:12:30.250
I'm scared..

1436
02:12:30.750 --> 02:12:33.291
Don't be afraid..

1437
02:12:33.791 --> 02:12:37.125
God will take care of everything..

1438
02:12:37.625 --> 02:12:41.125
God watches over the people we love.

1439
02:12:54.416 --> 02:12:57.375
Defence Minister.. the martyr..

1440
02:12:57.875 --> 02:13:05.875
.. one of India's favourite sons.. Bastard!

1441
02:13:06.375 --> 02:13:09.291
Read it. they're honoring him with the Bharat Ratna.

1442
02:13:09.791 --> 02:13:14.208
All our efforts, wasted.

1443
02:13:14.708 --> 02:13:16.291
People need to know the truth.

1444
02:13:16.791 --> 02:13:18.708
Sure..

1445
02:13:19.208 --> 02:13:21.750
We and have to surrender ourselves for it.

1446
02:13:22.250 --> 02:13:23.583
What?

1447
02:13:24.083 --> 02:13:28.500
Terrific! You want us to walk right..

1448
02:13:29.000 --> 02:13:32.958
..in and give ourselves up!

1449
02:13:33.458 --> 02:13:34.500
And whom should we surrender to?

1450
02:13:35.000 --> 02:13:37.166
The police are mere puppets.

1451
02:13:37.666 --> 02:13:39.541
So what should we do? Should we just sit back?

1452
02:13:40.041 --> 02:13:43.333
Let them say anything. - No! Let's kill them all!

1453
02:13:43.833 --> 02:13:45.791
Right Pandey? Bang! Bang! Bang!

1454
02:13:46.291 --> 02:13:49.791
Someone make him shut up!

1455
02:13:56.958 --> 02:14:00.166
You always knew that your father was in it.

1456
02:14:00.666 --> 02:14:04.583
You knew everything.

1457
02:14:05.083 --> 02:14:08.041
No I didn't know, Sukhi.. - Sukhi is dead..

1458
02:14:08.541 --> 02:14:09.583
You're lying!

1459
02:14:10.083 --> 02:14:11.875
You always wanted to take revenge on your father.

1460
02:14:12.375 --> 02:14:15.750
Sukhi, shut up! - I won't shut up.

1461
02:14:16.250 --> 02:14:19.833
Who am I to say anything? This Karan is only yours.

1462
02:14:20.333 --> 02:14:25.250
Hey Sukhi. - DJ he's used you.. - Shut up Sukhi.

1463
02:14:25.750 --> 02:14:27.875
.. he's used all of us, all of us.

1464
02:14:28.375 --> 02:14:32.916
Mark my words, he will be safe, his father will bail him out.

1465
02:14:33.416 --> 02:14:37.458
But we'll get caught. And I don't want to die DJ.. - Sukhi.

1466
02:14:37.958 --> 02:14:41.458
I don't want to die.

1467
02:14:45.625 --> 02:14:49.125
We did all this for Ajay.

1468
02:14:52.208 --> 02:14:55.708
What will happen now DJ?

1469
02:15:02.166 --> 02:15:06.000
You've decided? - Yes.

1470
02:15:06.500 --> 02:15:11.000
I need to know the truth.. don't worry.

1471
02:15:11.500 --> 02:15:14.958
I'm not worried. Just don't be late.

1472
02:15:15.458 --> 02:15:18.083
The night is still young and the show's name is 'Raat Baki Baat Baki'

1473
02:15:18.583 --> 02:15:20.083
.. and I am Rahul, let's rock the party.

1474
02:15:20.583 --> 02:15:22.958
There's great DJ remixes coming up.

1475
02:15:23.458 --> 02:15:26.958
Nowadays new songs don't work old songs are..

1476
02:15:30.541 --> 02:15:32.291
Nothing will happen to you Karan.

1477
02:15:32.791 --> 02:15:34.666
That's a promise, nothing will happen to you.

1478
02:15:35.166 --> 02:15:38.541
Just give me the names of the others.

1479
02:15:39.041 --> 02:15:40.541
I have good contacts.

1480
02:15:41.041 --> 02:15:42.708
I'll get you the best lawyers, pull all the strings possible.

1481
02:15:43.208 --> 02:15:45.291
But I will get you out from it.

1482
02:15:45.791 --> 02:15:49.666
You just have to say that you were forced into it..

1483
02:15:50.166 --> 02:15:50.833
.. do you understand ?

1484
02:15:51.333 --> 02:15:55.041
And then you are out of this country.

1485
02:15:55.541 --> 02:15:58.791
Say something. Do you get me?

1486
02:15:59.291 --> 02:16:01.958
Say something Damn it, Your father's reputation..

1487
02:16:02.458 --> 02:16:04.125
..his life's work is at stake.

1488
02:16:04.625 --> 02:16:09.541
Why did you do it? Why did you do it?

1489
02:16:10.041 --> 02:16:10.916
Why did you do it, Dad?

1490
02:16:11.416 --> 02:16:14.500
I.. What did I do?

1491
02:16:15.000 --> 02:16:17.291
These people don't fear death.

1492
02:16:17.791 --> 02:16:20.000
Ajay used to say..

1493
02:16:20.500 --> 02:16:25.458
..let death come.. anything for the country.

1494
02:16:25.958 --> 02:16:30.958
Ajay..

1495
02:16:31.458 --> 02:16:36.500
You'll handle it, out of the country.

1496
02:16:37.000 --> 02:16:42.500
Ajay was burnt alive.. not for the country.

1497
02:16:43.000 --> 02:16:45.083
You killed him!

1498
02:16:45.583 --> 02:16:47.708
You made him a joke..

1499
02:16:48.208 --> 02:16:50.750
I know you're very disturbed.

1500
02:16:51.250 --> 02:16:53.291
What has happened has happened.

1501
02:16:53.791 --> 02:16:56.791
Relax! Let me handle things.

1502
02:16:57.291 --> 02:17:00.541
I'll find a way out.

1503
02:17:01.041 --> 02:17:02.375
Really Dad? Is there a way out?

1504
02:17:02.875 --> 02:17:06.375
Of course. There are many ways.

1505
02:17:09.166 --> 02:17:12.666
Yes we'll go away from this country tonight.

1506
02:18:15.041 --> 02:18:19.125
You don't have to do this..

1507
02:18:19.625 --> 02:18:22.458
I want to.

1508
02:18:22.958 --> 02:18:27.833
Sukhi, this might end badly.

1509
02:18:28.333 --> 02:18:34.125
Without you guys it will end for me anyway..

1510
02:18:34.625 --> 02:18:38.125
Idiot. Come.

1511
02:18:47.041 --> 02:18:50.541
Ajay passed away. But his death won't go in vain, ma.

1512
02:18:58.500 --> 02:19:04.416
What is it about these boys that make them have no fear?

1513
02:19:04.916 --> 02:19:07.666
I think some times a person can be pushed so..

1514
02:19:08.166 --> 02:19:13.833
